  "prefLabel": "Liq 102.03 Division of Marketing, Merchandising, and Warehousing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 102.03 Division of Marketing, Merchandising, and Warehousing. The division of marketing, merchandising, and warehousing shall oversee the commission’s functions related to marketing, merchandising, purchasing, store operations, warehousing, and distribution.\n\nSource. #13612, eff 4-25-23",
